{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24667","headline":"初致仕後戏酬留守牛相公幷呈分司诸寮友 · 白居易","name":"初致仕後戏酬留守牛相公幷呈分司诸寮友","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"南北东西无所羁，挂冠目在胜分司。\n探花尝酒多先到，拜表行香尽不知。\n炮笋烹鱼饱飱後，拥袍枕臂醉眠时。\n报君一语君应笑，兼亦无心羡保厘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24667.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24667","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}